### What we derived

- `references/playbook.json` and `references/playbook-packs/` are structured
  extracts of Playbook subcategory content for machine-assisted assessment.
- `references/rmf-core.md` / `rmf-profiles.md` summarize RMF concepts for agents.
- `references/nist-ai-security-overlay.md` uses threat/GenAI language inspired by
  NIST AI 100-2 and NIST AI 600-1 (prompt sheet only — not a second scored catalog).

